"title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7MDXkkKGe", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "深刻", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "18503-18578", "abstract": "多元文化主义不可避免的矛盾就在于，如果它禁止极端观念，就会违背自己的原则，如果它容忍极端观念，又会导致自身的失败。我觉得，今天西方社会的情形就是如此。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "17408780_7MDXkkKGe", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1699687801, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "景凯旋 在人性残缺的时代，成为一个完整的人", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7MuQf7NcQ", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "这个说法有趣！", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "14749-14843", "abstract": "大多数世界名校都在英美两国，而这两个国家的社会不平等现象也最为严重。用我的话来讲，大学几乎是一个“洗钱机器”(money laundry machine)，将金融资本转化为文化和政治资本。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7MuQf7NcQ", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1699170109, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "项飙 迈克尔·桑德尔 走出对成功的崇拜——从精英的傲慢看优绩主义陷阱", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7MuQ5VtWC", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "可是人类太喜欢故事了，传奇的成功故事。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "13154-13217", "abstract": "过分推崇个人成功故事的危险在于，它会分散我们的注意力，无暇为社会平等创造更多条件，比如重建公共领域，重视农村地区的中小学教育。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7MuQ5VtWC", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1699169974, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "项飙 迈克尔·桑德尔 走出对成功的崇拜——从精英的傲慢看优绩主义陷阱", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7MuORZpjV", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "中国大地上也在发生同样的事情，只是缺少政治的宣泄途径。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "6304-6341", "abstract": "你提醒了我们，民粹主义反扑精英的原因之一，就是工薪阶层认为精英瞧不起他们。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7MuORZpjV", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "createTime": 1699168851, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "项飙 迈克尔·桑德尔 走出对成功的崇拜——从精英的傲慢看优绩主义陷阱", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7MuNKgZJ6", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "中国的选贤主要是基于科举制度完成的，与西方的精英逻辑有本质的区别，只能说有相似之处而已。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "2991-3027", "abstract": "千年前的《礼记》里就提到：“大道之行也，天下为公。选贤与能，讲信修睦。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7MuNKgZJ6", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1699167821, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "项飙 迈克尔·桑德尔 走出对成功的崇拜——从精英的傲慢看优绩主义陷阱", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7MpacIDhO", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "《同呼吸》", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "32608-32681", "abstract": "这个意义上，（记录）是有意义的。比如说，在各地因为过度防疫受到伤害的人，如果做不了别的事情，就做记录，为历史、为未来留下材料，我觉得这是有意义的。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7MpacIDhO", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1698847595, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "罗新 太多人滥用历史，历史学家应该监督对历史的叙述", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Mp9RBKoY", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "不知道罗老师怎样看待《叫魂》《翦商》这两本书，算不算在慢慢澄清一些历史呢？", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "29700-29736", "abstract": "把那些基本概念、基本观念一点一点地澄清，并在这个基础上对某些事实做出矫正", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7Mp9RBKoY", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1698847283, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "罗新 太多人滥用历史，历史学家应该监督对历史的叙述", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Mp9xFA6s", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "当大部分人被深埋在这样的历史认知中，就自然而然地形成了普遍的民族主义。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "28897-29161", "abstract": "罗：挺有意思，我最近看我挺喜欢的耶鲁大学历史学家蒂莫西·施耐德(Timothy Snyder)这学期在耶鲁开的一门课《现代乌克兰的形成》，这门课的每一讲都上网，他在课里提出一个“深地理”(deep geography)的概念，说的就是帕特里克说的我们关于民族主义、关于历史的那些错误的理解。我们的历史教育里已经深深灌满了这些东西。因为我们的历史就是这样讲过来的，一代一代都这样讲，一代一代反复确认前一代人的话。我们的教育，无非就是对过去的确认。这样就形成了“深地理”，作为我们基本思维的深层、底盘，这就是民族主义。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7Mp9xFA6s", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1698846989, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "罗新 太多人滥用历史，历史学家应该监督对历史的叙述", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Mp9oOopJ", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "一切为政治服务，勇敢点说出来。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "28416-28584", "abstract": "但是，在这个语境下，有人就往前多走了一步，不但相信夏商周存在，而且相信更早的时代也存在，特别是在某种现实利益的驱动下，把中华文明往前推。这种认识背后的思想方法，是认为所谓的文明是单一因素、单一地域、单一人群的成果，我相信这在现代西方学术界是不可能接受的事情，但成了中国一部分学者努力的方向，也许不只是学者，还有更重要的力量在背后起作用。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7Mp9oOopJ", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1698846858, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "罗新 太多人滥用历史，历史学家应该监督对历史的叙述", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7MmdbqCdt", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "要看看这本书。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "5538-5633", "abstract": "在这一点上，我特别喜欢清华哲学系教授黄裕生写的《权利的形而上学》，那本书虽然没有明确写这句话，但我觉得（可以概括出来）：自由是人的天性，人类实现自由是天性决定的。我们的天性决定了我们的方向。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7MmdbqCdt", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1698679924, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "罗新 太多人滥用历史，历史学家应该监督对历史的叙述", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7LN2eomY2", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "自媒体该登场了，讨论太久传统媒体如何变革了。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "26387-26465", "abstract": "但换个角度，所谓中产阶层文化之外没有其他文化，表述的是某种社会文化观察，某种凸显在流媒体/融媒体/新媒介平台的文化事实，而非网络空间之为文化空间的全部事实。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7LN2eomY2", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1696681882, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "戴锦华 火焰与黑洞——媒介的变化，如何改变我们", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7LN1fQkbG", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "这点与事实不符，冷战后好莱坞出品了大量太空科幻电影，这从一个角度可以证明欧美民族仍然对太空抱有热情和想象。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "14757-14855", "abstract": "对此，逻辑的阐释，是人们对于外太空探索的好奇和热情。这在中国可以成立，因为我们有着世界领先的、不断推进的航天工业。而在欧美世界，尤其是美国，地外太空、地外文明的探索，几乎已与冷战终结同时陷于停滞。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7LN1fQkbG", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1696680987, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "戴锦华 火焰与黑洞——媒介的变化，如何改变我们", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7LN0TaUoh", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "马克思·韦伯怎么还跟绝地求生扯上联系了？", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "12827-12939", "abstract": "此间最为突出的，当然是游戏的主流范式。首先是竞技类游戏的“大逃杀”范型。绝地求生或荒野图存的设定，在字面意义上确定了你死我活、赢家通吃的游戏结构。而这类游戏的基础逻辑，则鲜有例外地，被我调侃地称为“新教伦理与资本主义精神”。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7LN0TaUoh", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1696680652, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "戴锦华 火焰与黑洞——媒介的变化，如何改变我们", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7LLlpb2Hf", "review": {"bookId": "3300065341", "content": "现在绝大多数人都是后者，说集体无意识也好，或者也可以称作内卷，都是个体不够鲜明，缺少独立判断的结果。", "bookVersion": 1573316777, "range": "23516-23861", "abstract": "1957年“反右”以后，接着搞过一个运动叫“除四害”，每个人每天要交上多少蚊子、苍蝇。朱正和我两个人在一起就说，这种事作为全民运动是没有任何意义的。不上班，大家晚上都不睡觉去捉蚊子、捉苍蝇，捉不完的，蚊子滋生的环境没有改变。另外一个人就说，我们现在这些人，如果有一半的人像我们这样认识，这个运动自然没有了。我认为这个话就说到了点子上，我不可能去反对这个运动，我不动可以吧？我装病，我病了，我睡在床上，不上班。假如我们都有这个认识，我不干这个事情，全国人民都不干，自然就干不了。这里有些人不仅是干，而且他还更积极，领导讲消灭一个，他还要消灭十个。有这样的人，就是这样的现实。这有什么办法，就要尽力去启蒙。我讲一句真心话，我是觉得我写的每一篇文字，哪怕是一则短文，我都是希望能够尽量起一点作用。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4, "reviewId": "17408780_7LLlpb2Hf", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1696585847, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300065341", "format": "epub", "version": 1994677372, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/59/cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso/s_cpplatform_u1suewytyekkdxxtae6cso1703145936.jpg", "title": "多谈谈问题（单读33）", "author": "吴琦", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 4, "chapterTitle": "锺叔河 真理有可能早过时代，但是寻找真理与时代无关", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 17}}